00:12:53,333 --> 00:12:59,333
How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days is a comedy, romance
film directed by Donald Petrie.

3
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:26,000
It's the battle of wills, as Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10
days, whereas Ben needs to prove he can win a girl in 10 days.

4
00:25:46,666 --> 00:25:52,666
Now, the clock is ticking—and the wildly entertaining comedy smash is off and running in
this irresistible tale of sex, lies and outrageous romantic fireworks!

5
